  "2026-10-25T14:13:58.377Z","harness:codex","October25 live inventory: zero open Dependabot/code/secret-scanning alerts and zero open PRs. pnpm outdated reports13 candidates: Sentry CLI3.8.2, jscpd5.4.2, Stryker core/runner10.1.1, Knip6.43.0, typescript-eslint8.72.0, CodSpeed6.1.0, Sentry Node11.9.0, Vitest/coverage5.0.5, Unicorn79.0.0, npm-package-arg14.0.0 and TypeScript7.0.2. Routine release-age qualification remains under this canonical maintenance lineage; major compatibility remains with existing pm-fokyhh, pm-t3jxjj, pm-do5b and pm-ksr40d. No package was blindly upgraded and no security finding is inferred from mere version availability. Current implementation scope remains pm-gh1579/pm-gh1585."
